        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6294531159579-How-to-create-a-tap-to-text-sticker-on-Instagram#h_01JJWJQKQEXDMDJKD6DV550HFD",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/6294531159579-How-to-create-a-tap-to-text-sticker-on-Instagram#h_01JJWJQKQEXHVAVQNTQX43965C",
          "text": "Before you begin"
